# | **Total** | **2,872** | **2,563** | **100.00%** | **1,540** | **1,332** |
# 
# All included classes met the required distinct-group minimums: six in training, two in validation, and two in testing. Overall record shares satisfied the inclusive three-percentage-point tolerance around 70/15/15. Individual class shares could differ more. Class-specific group counts can overlap across classes when a group contains several labels.
# 
