# | Metrics, predictions, class report, feature diagnostics, fit log, checks, error audit and diagnostic breakdown CSVs | 8 |
# | Baseline configuration JSON | 1 |
# | Fitted majority model and complete TF-IDF/logistic pipeline | 2 |
# | Labeled count and row-normalized confusion figures for both models | 4 |
