# 
# The saved check ledger contains 245 cumulative records, including repeated integrity checks, artificial contracts and development-result checks. The artificial portions comprise 18 component scenarios and 52 checks. These counts are implementation evidence, not independent model experiments.
# 
# A separate 25 save/readback checks passed. A fresh Python process loaded both saved models and reproduced all 870 model/record predictions—two models evaluated on the same 435 cases—and their 16 probability columns. The reload used importable preprocessing functions and performed no model fitting.
