# 
# We completed classifier packaging, controlled development tagging, and the version-bound handoff for Step 23. The saved models reproduce their reference outputs, and the development catalog preserves source labels separately from model suggestions. Human tag review, independent source verification, and retrieval/planner approvals remain pending.
# 
