# | Planning workflows | The differences between Versions 1–4 |
# | Evaluation | Matched profiles, independent checks, human review, and resource measurements |
# | Main findings | Observed improvements, regressions, uncertainty, and practical tradeoffs |
# | Application demonstration | The tested user workflow |
# | Limitations and future work | What the evidence supports and what needs further investigation |
# 
# We will distinguish the neural classifier trained within the project from the pretrained models used for generation and retrieval.
# 
# We will explain technical terms when they first appear and use diagrams that match the implemented system.
