# | Action | What we will show |
# |---|---|
# | Enter and save the profile | Record relevant goals, availability, existing commitments, and resources |
# | Generate a response | Run the configured bounded Version 4 workflow |
# | Inspect the result | Explain the schedule, references, check results, and unresolved issues |
# | Save a supported edit | Create a new plan revision and rerun the coded checks |
# | Inspect review status | Show that the earlier model assessment becomes stale after a material edit |
# | Review saved changes | Run the supported evaluator action without automatically rewriting the plan |
# | Track progress | Update the status of a top-level training session |
